        <activityName xml:lang="en">Borehole heat exchanger, 300m</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Borehole heat exchanger, 300m
Inventory for the production of a 300m deep borehole heat exchanger with a life time of at least 50 years.  UUID: 91cf4b23-e335-32e9-9f30-2c96e178dd83
Infrastructure of the geothermal probe, including all material inputs (pipes and backfill material, coolant) and also the energy use for building the borehole with machines. Disposal of intertwaste.
Location: Data apply to the supply in Switzerland.
Technology: Industry data.
Time period: Time of publications.
Production volume: 
Sampling: Data provided by manufacturer
Extrapolations: 
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_91cf4b23-e335-32e9-9f30-2c96e178dd83.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
